    dmo:statement "A multidisciplinary approach involving stroke and diabetes teams to develop local protocols and periodic training for the staff on the comprehensive assessment and management of hyperglycaemia is appropriate, as is an agreed approach to functional assessment and management of frailty." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "A multidisciplinary approach involving stroke and diabetes teams to develop local protocols and periodic training for the staff on the comprehensive assessment and management of hyperglycaemia is appropriate, as is an agreed approach to functional assessment and management of frailty." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_15_frail_older_adult_with_diabetes_february_2023> .

