    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Monitoring" ;
    dmo:statement "All of these issues highlight the need for a full multidisciplinary evaluation for the presence of risk factors and a review of glycaemic targets to ensure that diabetes control is appropriate, with each opportunity facilitating a review of dietary choices and medication to ensure that hypoglycaemia risk is proactively managed and symptomatic hyperglycaemia avoided" ;
