    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_15_frail_older_adult_with_diabetes_february_2023> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/individualisation-of-glycaemic-goals-based-on-comorbidities-and-functional-status> a dmo:Recommendation ;
