<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/where-possible-or-indicated-flash-glucose-monitoring-and-other-wearables-should-be-considered-to-enhance-blood-glucose-monitoring-and-avoid-frequent-skin-pricking-for-capillary-glucose-measurement> a dmo:Recommendation ;
